'''Nurse Shark''' is an {{Uncommon}} [[Sea Creatures|Sea Creature]] that can be fished up from water during the [[Fishing Festival]].

== Spawning ==
'''Nurse Shark''' can be fished up from water during the [[Fishing Festival]]. It requires {{Skill|fishing|5}} to be fished up. 

[[Sea Creatures#Shark|Fishing Festival Sea Creatures]] have a {{Green|15%}} base chance to override other Sea Creature spawns. Certain modifiers can be used to increase it:

