The base [[Sea Creatures#Sea Creature Weight|Weight]] for '''Nurse Shark''' is {{Green|2,875}}, resulting in a catch chance of {{Chance|57.79%|1|1.73|sea creatures}} in [[Sea Creatures#Shark|Fishing Festival Sea Creatures]] pool with all Sea Creatures unlocked. Currently there are no modifiers that can be used to increase it.

